/S /H2
/P 146 0 R
/T (User feedback across Reddit and social media highlights growing concerns around price transparency in food delivery. Users report frustration when attractive discounts and item prices are followed by additional charges such as packaging, delivery, platform fees, taxes, and other applicable fees. This creates a mismatch between the expected and final price, leading to price shock, lower perceived value, and reduced trust in the platform)
